        "original_id": "d964ad65-83f2-55a6-98a2-74eba1bfbb14",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chris Reason, Man Haron Monis\n- Events: 2014 Sydney hostage crisis, Sydney siege, Lindt Cafe siege\n- Awards: Graham Perkin Australian Journalist of the Year Award\n- Places: Lindt chocolate café, Martin Place, Sydney, Australia\n\nFacts:\n- On 15–16 December 2014, the 2014 Sydney hostage crisis, also known as the Sydney siege and the Lindt Cafe siege, took place at a Lindt chocolate café in Martin Place, Sydney, Australia.\n- During the 2014 Sydney hostage crisis, Man Haron Monis held ten customers and eight employees hostage at the Lindt chocolate café.\n- In December 2014, Chris Reason received the Graham Perkin Australian Journalist of the Year Award for his coverage of the Lindt Cafe siege.",
